{"song": "The_Rinn_-_Voices__2017_Version_", "config": "final_patched", "model": "models/asr", "seconds": 231.2243125, "maxNewTokens": 368, "elapsed": 234.2811632156372, "exit": 0, "chunks": [{"index": 1, "offset": 30.43, "length": 32.1, "raw": "\"The sun is fading under blood red sky. The reign of day is over.\""}, {"index": 5, "offset": 148.75, "length": 31.22, "raw": "\"World gets gone forever. A lot of gold.\""}, {"index": 0, "offset": 0.0, "length": 30.43, "raw": "\"The.\""}, {"index": 3, "offset": 91.0, "length": 29.39, "raw": "\"It's bright. You're waking in the morning. Can't understand your feelings. And when you get these thoughts inside your mind, the voice calling for the night to rise at your side. Oh, love, the sun forever morning. Lost in the night, the light shine with me.\""}, {"index": 2, "offset": 62.52, "length": 28.48, "raw": "\"Night, so we'll break free. They wake in the eerie glow of moonlight. Forgotten shadows beyond our sight. World is gone forever. All that's gone was in the eyes that shine. We miss we lost we made each other's last night. Whispering they will rise.\""}, {"index": 4, "offset": 120.39, "length": 28.35, "raw": "\"We lost, we made shadows. Upside, whisper you there would lie. Don't hear the voice sharing the yearning, keep it deep into you. Hear the voice sharing the memories, sacred secrets from past time.\""}, {"index": 6, "offset": 179.97, "length": 27.6, "raw": "\"The shine we missed, we lost, we made in shadows of our sight. Whispering the old lies. So hear the voice sharing the gunning, keep them keeping to you. Hear the voice sharing the memories, secrets, secrets from.\""}, {"index": 7, "offset": 207.57, "length": 23.65, "raw": "\"Hear the voice sharing the agony, keeping it within you. Hear the voice.\""}], "result": {"language": "English", "text": "The.The sun is fading under blood red sky. The reign of day is over.Night, so we'll break free. They wake in the eerie glow of moonlight. Forgotten shadows beyond our si